<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling weakens vs dlr, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling weakens vs dlr, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar and the pound on Wednesday, according to figures released by the central bank.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 599.6925 against the dollar compared to 599.6727 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling traded at a mean rate 980.2604 from 979.1771 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
